  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two boxes with masses <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> travel towards each other in a straight line, collide and stick together. The initial speed of the blocks is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"u\"></span>. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>As a result of the collision, the total change of linear momentum of the objects is:</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">zero</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mv + Mu\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mv - Mu\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Mu - mv\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
